      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but my doctor is busy and i can't get an appointment until next week and i'm honestly struggling to even move right now. is the risk of serotonin syndrome really that common or is it just a rare thing? i feel like i've taken other stuff before and been fine. like, how much would i actually have to take for it to be a problem?",
